# The stock Seafoam predicate is shared by initial-avatar and fall-warp
# callers.  Its implementation hard-codes only physical group 1, so the
# canonical Kanto projection at group 97 silently loses the same engine
# semantics even when every script/flag producer is correct.  Replace the
# complete entry (not its callers) with an ABI-identical Stage61 predicate and
# pin enough of the original body to fail closed on ROM drift.
