# CFRU-JP widens gBaseStats from 28 to 32 bytes.  Its fixed upstream
# special_inserts.asm correctly widens CreateBoxMon's growth-rate lookup at
# 0x0803D35A, but the friendship lookup at 0x0803D384 writes ``lsl r0,r1,#5``.
# At that point r1 is SP and the following call consumes r2, so the widened
# base-stat pointer is never formed.  The corresponding pinned C source is
# unambiguous: SetBoxMonData(..., MON_DATA_FRIENDSHIP,
# &gBaseStats[species].friendship).  Repair only the malformed Thumb halfword
# and pin the complete surrounding dataflow plus both source identities.
