# bytes into the compact CFRU BoxPokemon header, making two bytes after a
# short Japanese name depend on stale stack contents.  The canonical table is
# already fully EOS-padded for every Species, so make the existing loop copy
# its complete row by replacing only the early-exit branch with a Thumb NOP.
