# Stage09 accidentally turned five ``species <= 412`` sentinel guards into
# unconditional branches.  A normal 0xFFFF LoadMonPicInWindow sentinel then
# indexed the canonical species table far out of range and let LZ overwrite
# heap state.  The fifth site is the post-catch palette loader; leaving it
# unpatched makes a real species-491 capture crash before CAUGHT/party state is
# committed even though the direct front/back/icon sprite APIs all pass.  The
# Stage61 payload is too far away for Thumb-1 BL, so use the
# eight-byte low-ROM cave immediately after the Stage09 nickname veneer.  The
# thunk returns the canonical upper bound (1620) in r0 and touches no other
