    # rows exposes results 4..6/7 and leaves ScriptContext locked.  Preserve
    # both namespaces: the table materializer relocates the clean rows to
    # 70..73, while these exact clean-script operands are redirected to the
    # dedicated rows.  The Stage60 project consumers of original 57..60 stay
    # byte-identical.
